---
/* L90 - what is already on the map, and the blank part of it. */
---

<figure class="fig">
  <div class="fig__frame">
    <img
      class="fig__picture"
      src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}illustrations/L90.jpg`}
      alt="A line drawing of a framed grid map whose left half is crowded with pins, while a hand places a new pin in the empty right half."
    />
    <svg
      class="fig__svg"
      viewBox="0 0 640 340"
      role="img"
      aria-labelledby="L90-fig-title L90-fig-desc"
    >
      <title id="L90-fig-title">The axis that is already on the map, and the gap that is not</title>
      <desc id="L90-fig-desc">
        Two panels. The left panel, headed published work on synthetic states, holds
        three bars for the same refund request in three serialisations: prose at
        0.90, flat at 0.86 and nested at 0.09. The right panel, headed the gap on
        your own tickets, is drawn as an empty frame and contains the plan: 20 real
        tickets, three serialisations by three repeats equals 180 calls, about
        $0.001 at $0.038 per million tokens, kill criteria written before the run,
        and the words no source found.
      </desc>

      <!-- published work -->
      <text x="30" y="42" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" letter-spacing="0.09em" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">PUBLISHED - SYNTHETIC STATES</text>
      <line x1="30" y1="230" x2="300" y2="230" stroke="var(--color-ink-45)" stroke-width="1" />
      <rect x="44" y="100" width="60" height="130" fill="var(--color-ink)" />
      <text x="74" y="92" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">0.90</text>
      <rect x="118" y="106" width="60" height="124" fill="var(--color-ink)" />
      <text x="148" y="98" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">0.86</text>
      <rect x="192" y="217" width="60" height="13" fill="var(--color-prussian)" />
      <text x="222" y="209" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="11" fill="var(--color-prussian)">0.09</text>
      <text x="74" y="246" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">prose</text>
      <text x="148" y="246" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">flat</text>
      <text x="222" y="246" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">nested</text>
      <text x="30" y="272" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">the same refund request, already measured</text>

      <!-- the gap -->
      <text x="330" y="42" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" letter-spacing="0.09em" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">THE GAP - YOUR OWN TICKETS</text>
      <path
        class="m-draw"
        style="--m-length: 540; --m-duration: 1.6s;"
        d="M 330 56 H 610 V 250 H 330 Z"
        fill="none"
        stroke="var(--color-prussian)"
        stroke-width="1"
      />
      <text x="346" y="86" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">20 real tickets</text>
      <text x="346" y="108" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">3 serialisations x 3 repeats = 180 calls</text>
      <text x="346" y="130" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-70)">about $0.001 at $0.038/Mtok</text>
      <text x="346" y="152" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">kill criteria written before the run</text>
      <text x="470" y="200" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="12" fill="var(--color-prussian)">no source found</text>
      <text x="330" y="272" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">not measured: real tickets, one provider</text>

      <text x="30" y="302" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">prior work: 24 labelled cases, 96% / 92% -&gt; 83% / 79%, 159-call battery, 6 of 6 injection probes</text>
      <text x="30" y="324" font-family="var(--font-mono)" font-size="10" fill="var(--color-ink-45)">novelty is a delta, not a topic: the same axis, your own data, the raw probability committed</text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="fig__caption">
    <span class="edge-code">figure L90</span>
    <span class="fig__caption-text">The format axis is already measured on synthetic states; the blank panel is the same axis on your own tickets, and it costs about a tenth of a cent.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  /* scoped to this figure */
  .fig__svg {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }
</style>
